# Supabase tooling

This project already has:

1. **npm scripts** — `db:push`, `db:status`, `db:login`, `db:link` in `package.json`
2. **Supabase MCP** — use for migrations, SQL, schema, advisors (load the supabase skill when relevant)

When a migration needs applying, run **`npm run db:push`** (or use MCP `apply_migration` / list status) instead of telling the user to paste SQL into the dashboard. See `docs/agents/supabase.md` and `AGENTS.md`.
